WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:08.870
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:14.040
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:16.470
This will do it.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:28.370
Protocol Omega makes the first point!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.050
I told you so.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:38.030
Did you see that? You did, right?

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.930
The real power of Protocol Omega 3.0.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:43.850
This match has only started, guys!

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.630
We're just getting warmed up!

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.740
Captain is right!

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:49.440
Let's give it our all!

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:51.960
That's the spirit!

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:58.370
By heightening your powers to their limit, you just might be able to awaken Jeanne's power!

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:03.780
Jeanne...

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.440
I have to go.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:16.470
I have to lead the others at the front.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.830
The newest production by Universal Studios!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.240
It was so exciting!

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.000
A competition to find the rare seed!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:02.950
For the future of the forest!

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:04.790
Will what jumps out at you be humor?!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.410
It was fun!

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.250
Or sadness?

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.410
I was very moved.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.610
Wait, what? Who are you?!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:12.690
That's right!

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.750
I am the Lorax!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.340
You aren't Shimura Ken?

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.130
The attraction 3D show now in theatres!

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.760
The Lorax and The Secret Seed!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.570
Now, the match resumes!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.280
Right.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:44.200
What?

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.070
He can predict us after all!

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:49.870
This is the power that Zanark-sama has bestowed upon us!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.660
Quarth!

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.450
They're too fast!

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:57.080
I couldn't even see that!

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.090
I can't move...

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:06.970
Why?

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.390
Still no good!

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:15.600
Kirino!

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.610
Darna is trapped!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:19.650
Shindou...

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:25.240
Concentrate on the game!

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:26.130
An opening!

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.830
Oh dear, Kirino is left behind!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:29.810
Don't get distracted!

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:32.700
Bahams!

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.330
I reached it!

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:39.960
Nice cut, Kinako!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.920
Miss Jeanne, did you see that?

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.510
I shouldn't be like this...

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.380
I know I shouldn't...

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:51.520
But...

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.080
Jeanne...

00:04:58.650 --> 00:04:59.860
Quarth!

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.110
Tenma!

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:07.080
I can tell what you're going to do next!

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:07.820
I won't give up!

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:09.310
Stop!

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:10.780
Dribble back!

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:13.910
Just come back.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.850
What's your deal?!

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.400
That's what I want to know.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:20.710
Fei!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.670
I'll score no matter what.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.010
All right, come on back!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:32.010
What exactly does the Dauphin Charles have in mind?

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.000
Please, Heavenly Father.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:39.900
Give me courage.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.970
Our army keeps being pressed back.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:45.030
At this rate, we'll lose!

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.700
Reinforcements will come soon!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.940
God will surely lead us to victory!

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.500
If you can hear God's voice, then tell me...

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:58.260
Why does God test us in this way?

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.260
Well...

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.420
Were we right to have believed in you?

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.560
I heard Him.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.450
I heard God's voice.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.050
I really did...

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:17.530
Advance!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.080
Fall back!

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:24.020
Are you guys screwing around with us?!

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:29.070
How is that? I call it the Back-and-Forth strategy.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.910
That's ridiculous.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.370
They're only making the other team angrier.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.440
Cut it out!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:40.910
Oh? Do you not like my strategy?

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:43.320
<i>What</i>  strategy?

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:47.290
We're just wasting away our energy for your own amusement!

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:48.010
Tenma!

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:49.880
All right then!

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:51.430
Go attack.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.600
Quit scampering around!

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.600
What?!

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:04.960
Oh là là!

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.170
He really got through.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.580
How?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.030
Fei!

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:10.690
We can do this!

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:11.400
Yeah!

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:16.950
Did he make them mad on purpose so their anger would block them from predicting us?

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:20.870
That is correct.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.350
Predicting ahead of the ahead of the ahead of the ahead.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:25.670
This is what you call a strategy.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.920
Voilà!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.380
Raimon charges ahead!

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.260
Make it in.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:40.130
The first half ends!

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:48.310
The Dauphin's strategy may have worked, but at this rate we'll be too exhausted in the second half...

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:51.140
It's okay! We can still go on.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:51.920
Yeah.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.990
We've managed to find a way through them.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.990
But if you keep this up, it'll eat up your stamina.

00:07:57.480 --> 00:07:59.070
Not to worry.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:01.850
I have already thought of my next move.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.910
What am I so irritated about?

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.090
Hey, Kirino.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.880
Oh! Sorry.

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:19.190
The second half will begin momentarily!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.770
What's this? Raimon has changed positions!

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:27.160
They've switched their forwards with defenders!

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:33.530
Even I didn't expect that!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:38.180
This is a strategy that will predict ahead of the ahead of the ahead of the ahead!

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:39.340
Voilà!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:44.000
Are we going to be okay, changing the formation like this?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.040
It's not like we have any other way.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:47.840
It'll be fine!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:48.920
Things will work out somehow!

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:52.340
Let's trust the Dauphin Charles on this one!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.310
Now, if only Jeanne will come around...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:08.180
<i>Were we right to have believed in you?</i>

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:10.930
Jeanne!

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.150
Did you really hear it?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.160
Are you sure you weren't just hearing things?

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.460
Are you sure?

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:19.860
Did you really hear it?

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.410
Hear the voice of God?

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:29.200
How do we get Jeanne-san's power to awaken?

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:31.010
At the rate this is going...

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:37.470
<i>If I run away, the suffering of the French people will not end.</i>

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:38.880
<i>Jeanne...</i>

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:41.160
<i>I was chosen.</i>

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.860
I believe in Jeanne.

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.620
She has a heart stronger than anyone I've ever known.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:52.360
That's why I'm sure the Mixi-max will be a success.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:57.960
<i>There is something out there that only you can do.</i>

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:01.910
<i>Maybe that's why you were chosen, Jeanne.</i>

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:05.100
<i>Something that only I can do?</i>

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:09.990
I need to find it too.

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:12.680
That something that only I can do.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.430
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.490
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.590
My main position is being a forward!

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:33.980
Now I'll get to show my stuff!

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.080
Stop, stop, stop!

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.450
Follow the strategy!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:40.670
What?

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.890
Was that a pass miss?

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:44.410
Einam!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:47.950
Bahams!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:51.820
Einam!

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.420
You're a pesky bunch!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:11:02.810
Here, it's obvious that the defenders who aren't as tired were brought up front mainly to aim for pass cuts.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:05.930
This sure would get on my nerves.

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:10.100
T-That is correct!

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:12.650
This strategy is kind of unfair, isn't it?

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.170
I agree.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:16.270
Reiza!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:22.280
Now's my chance!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:26.990
You're not getting through!

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:29.950
Defense Command 03!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.250
<Coil Upper>

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:36.210
Darna takes back the ball!

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:44.420
The match continues while Kirino is unable to stand!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:46.470
Is this a chance for Protocol Omega?!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:47.890
No...

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.870
This is my fault...

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.420
Shoot Command-

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.020
Shindou!

00:11:57.660 --> 00:12:00.120
You attacked because you thought you could, right?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.260
Then I trust your judgment!

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.180
Let us handle covering you!

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:11.960
Shindou...

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:19.160
<i>Shindou-senpai has an Avatar, and now he can even Mixi-max and use Avatar Armed.</i>

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.510
<i>He's bounded so far ahead that you can't reach him.</i>

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:24.720
<i>That's pretty much what you're thinking, isn't it?</i>

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:26.770
Kariya.

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:28.530
You were right.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.600
All I kept thinking about was how resentful I felt that I got strung up...

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.850
And this is the result.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.100
I was jealous.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.820
Jealous of Shindou who rose above me.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.280
You little...!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.780
Kirino makes a fierce dash!

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.900
They have Orca trapped!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:51.910
Kirino!

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:54.470
My duty isn't to move up to the front!

00:12:56.390 --> 00:13:01.040
My duty is to support Shindou and the others so that they will be able to focus on attacking!

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:01.760
Kirino...

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:04.780
I finally understand what my purpose is.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:08.800
Just now...!

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:09.350
An Avatar!

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:10.430
Bahams!

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:17.580
Shindou.

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:18.660
I...

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.250
The only person I thought of was myself.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:27.950
There's no way I could have gained strength in that state of mind.

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:30.910
That answer you've reached suits you.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:33.660
Jeanne!

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.770
I finally understand!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:40.730
My purpose, the thing that only I can do!

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.710
You have something that only you can do, too!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:49.170
But nothing will come about, even with me being here...

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:53.890
I don't even know if the voice I heard really did come from God...

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.580
You have to believe in yourself!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:57.580
I believe in you!

00:13:57.990 --> 00:13:59.600
In your words!

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:03.130
If you believe that it's God speaking to you,

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:05.560
then that will give you the strength to push on, towards victory!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.410
Ranmaru...

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:12.110
The match resumes with Einam's throw-in!

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.450
Reiza!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.770
Battle Flag Warrior Brynhildr!

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:26.760
Kirino!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.220
Kirino-senpai!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.640
Offense Command 04!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.390
<Spinning Upper>

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.080
Kirino makes a cut with his Avatar!

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:44.190
This is the power of an Avatar...

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.620
Jeanne!

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.440
Don't you believe in your own abilities?

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:52.630
In what you see, and in what you say?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.910
I grew unsure of myself.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:00.450
At some point, I'd stopped believing even in myself.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:05.070
What makes you think that your comrades will follow you in that state of mind?!

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.300
I have to believe.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:14.140
In myself.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.980
My duty...

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:21.560
...isn't to hold the sword and stand on the battlefield.

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.440
My duty is to deliver God's words and inspire my comrades!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.290
Hear me, my soldiers!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.660
Devote your very soul to that cause and know that you will rise victorious!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:38.540
God will answer to your bravery!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:43.210
In God's name, I promise upon this flag that we will win this battle!

00:15:47.490 --> 00:15:49.050
What's wrong, Kinako?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:53.640
I was just thinking... that this is probably what it feels like to find a kindred spirit.

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:56.010
That's the real Jeanne.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.210
She looks so cool!

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:58.910
All right!

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.180
Now it's sure to work!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.900
No, not me! Over there!

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:11.360
Gah, I really shot him...

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.050
I figured it out!

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:16.360
The one who should Mixi-max is Kirino-senpai!

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:20.950
Mixi-max complete!

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.130
Kirino-senpai!

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:29.000
Kirino!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.090
I knew it wasn't me after all!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.680
Don't get cocky!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.140
What?!

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.570
Go, Tsurugi!

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.820
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.490
Armed!

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.040
I'll stop you!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.870
Keeper Command 07!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.420
<Gyro Saving>

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:14.380
Raimon ties the score!

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:16.930
The flow is on our side!

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.450
Attack, attack, and keep attacking!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:20.680
Yeah!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:25.600
From here on, Raimon's movements just keep getting better and better!

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:27.430
That's it!

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:28.950
Go, go!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.320
This is power #2!

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:38.820
A charismatic defender who rouses up his team's courage, changing it into an iron-wall defense!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:41.330
It's exactly the power that I have sought!

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:42.990
Kirino-senpai!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.700
Shindou!

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:48.330
Mixi-trans!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.250
Nobunaga!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.840
Split-second Boost!

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.350
Keeper Command 07!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.870
<Gyro Saving>

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:11.560
Raimon turns the score!

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:16.070
The match ends!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:19.070
Raimon wins at 2-1!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.190
We won...

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.790
We won!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:35.820
Useless.

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:37.470
Zanark-sa...

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.820
Attack, men!

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.140
Advance!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.770
For France!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:53.520
God has saved us!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:57.430
Praise God for this victory!

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.120
Jeanne...

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.180
Curse that Zanark!

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.710
He's using Protocol Omega as toys!

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:09.390
Are you quite sure we should be letting him do as he pleases?

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:12.310
He won't submit to our orders anyway.

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.750
Let him be.

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:18.090
To more important matters, why don't we deposit that thing into his custody?

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:24.240
It would be interesting to see what chemical reaction it will bring.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:32.230
Your great efforts were truly remarkable.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.730
Thank you for your praise.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.730
Thank you too, Your Royal Highness.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.820
Indeed, your victory was only assured by my command.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:42.780
Voilà!

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:48.170
I've heard that you will be departing?

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:48.700
Yes, sir.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.570
I will never forget my meeting with you.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:57.250
The next time we meet, it will be a soccer battle against a team that I lead.

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:00.710
I will show you a strategy that will leave you dumbstruck.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:01.590
Yes, sir.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:02.730
We won't lose!

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:05.660
You've said it now. You had best live up to those words.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:10.660
Are you going?

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.650
Yeah.

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:14.740
I'll put your power to good use, even in the future.

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:19.110
My power was something that I received from you.

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:24.020
Ranmaru, you have made me realize how important it is to believe in myself.

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:25.730
You have taught me the courage it takes to do it.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:30.450
Thanks to you, I can keep fighting from this day on.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:33.770
I want you to have this.

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:34.960
That's...

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.920
Don't you receive protection from that amulet?

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.150
I can't accept that.

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:43.340
But...

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:46.550
Then how about that instead?

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:01.540
This has your kindness in it.

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:02.960
Ranmaru...

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.560
Good work, everyone.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:16.640
We're now a step closer to the strongest eleven in history.

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:25.390
Jeanne...

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:37.280
Even if I give power to them, shrimp are still shrimp.

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:26.650
Our next Mixi-max takes place in the Three Kingdoms period!

00:23:26.650 --> 00:23:29.090
Even more powerful friends join us!

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:31.310
Amemiya Taiyou returns!

00:23:31.310 --> 00:23:33.880
Next, Liu Bei Is Funny!

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:36.030
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:49.560
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:51.340 --> 00:23:57.300
Predicting ahead of the ahead of the ahead of the ahead!
 This is what you call a strategy. Voilà!

00:23:57.300 --> 00:23:58.620
That's all!
